# path: in mode free, the AI's proposals (.archvow/proposals.vow) are not the architects' (ARCH050
# refuses any other file there).
# Enforced only with GitLab Premium/Ultimate and, on the protected default branch:
#   Settings > Repository > Branch rules > "Code owner approval" ON, "Allowed to push" = No one.
# The [Architecture guards] section is required (no ^ prefix) and needs 1 approval.

